{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"id\":\"N127\",\"lines\":\"--n-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N127.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"after\":\"The two speech turns can faintly sound like repeated talk.\",\"reason\":\"B003 names someone characterized by much speaking; the second قَالَ is one spoken turn, a single instance of that activity. Two turns do not establish excessive speech, so the link is thin.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N128\",\"lines\":\"-r-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N128.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"جَعَلَهُۥ\",\"after\":\"The verse sets false attribution against a real transformation. The iron is actually brought to a fire-state, rather than merely said to be so.\",\"reason\":\"The rare sense is saying what did not happen or falsely ascribing it (قول ما لم يكن); جَعَلَهُۥ means actually rendering something into a state (تصيير الشيء على حال). Heard together, false verbal attribution is answered by material change.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N129\",\"lines\":\"--n--\"}\n{\"id\":\"N129.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"after\":\"An utterance can be heard as one instance of speech drawn into oneself.\",\"reason\":\"B006 describes pulling a saying inward (اجترار القول إلى النفس); the other قَالَ is speech brought outward in an utterance. The two turns echo the same speech, though the verse does not say either speaker is inwardly rehearsing it.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N130\",\"lines\":\"--r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N130.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"نَارًا\",\"after\":\"The work's speech and its fire-state make an image of words spreading like flame. The commands carry the heated work from one person to another.\",\"reason\":\"B007 is speech that spreads among people (القول الفاشي بين الناس); نَارًا names blazing fire. Together they let the talk around the work be heard as spreading fire.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N131\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132\",\"lines\":\"nrn-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ءَاتُونِى\",\"after\":\"The supply command can be heard as one move in an exchange about the work.\",\"reason\":\"B009 means negotiating over a matter (المقاولة في الأمر), while ءَاتُونِى asks the workers to supply material. The request fits the subject of negotiation, but the command itself does not show a reciprocal bargain.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"سَاوَىٰ\",\"after\":\"The negotiation and the leveling of the gap echo one another. The physical sides are brought level as imagined negotiating sides seek an accord.\",\"reason\":\"B009 names negotiation over a matter (تفاوضنا), and سَاوَىٰ means making two things equal (مساواة ومعادلة). Together they picture a negotiation that levels differences between its sides.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N132.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ءَاتُونِىٓ\",\"after\":\"The second request can be heard as another turn in the exchange over the structure.\",\"reason\":\"B009 is discussion and negotiation about a matter (المقاولة في الأمر); ءَاتُونِىٓ asks for the material needed for the next operation. This is a real work-related pairing, though no bargaining is stated.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N133\",\"lines\":\"-r-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N133.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"جَعَلَهُۥ\",\"after\":\"The command sounds like a ruling carried out in metal. The iron is not only ordered about; it is made into a fire-state.\",\"reason\":\"B010 means imposing a judgment or ruling over another (اقتالة الحكم على غيره); جَعَلَهُۥ means rendering something into a state (تصيير الشيء على حال). Heard together, authoritative speech takes material effect in the transformation.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N134\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N135\",\"lines\":\"-rr-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N135.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱنفُخُوا۟\",\"after\":\"The inner word becomes the breath the workers send into the iron. The command gives an inward thought an audible and physical form.\",\"reason\":\"B012 is speech held in the soul before it appears in words (قول في النفس لم يظهر); ٱنفُخُوا۟ commands sending air into something (إرسال الريح في الشيء). Together they picture hidden speech emerging as the blast that heats the metal.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N135.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"أُفْرِغْ\",\"after\":\"The inward word becomes a pouring-out of molten material. What had not appeared in speech now takes visible form on the barrier.\",\"reason\":\"B012 describes a thought in the self not yet expressed (في نفسي قول لم أظهره); أُفْرِغْ means pouring out or emptying a vessel (الصب وإخلاء الوعاء). Their pairing makes the hidden thought seem to pour outward into action.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N136\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N137\",\"lines\":\"---r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N137.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"جَعَلَهُۥ\",\"after\":\"The metal's new state becomes its own declaration. What it has become makes the transformation legible.\",\"reason\":\"B014 uses قول for the indication carried by a thing (قول الشيء دلالته); جَعَلَهُۥ names changing the thing's state (تصيير الشيء على حال). The resulting condition can itself serve as a sign of what was done.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N138\",\"lines\":\"-nnr\"}\n{\"id\":\"N138.2\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱنفُخُوا۟\",\"after\":\"Care for the work can accompany the act of blowing.\",\"reason\":\"B015 means sincere concern for something (العناية الصادقة بالشيء); ٱنفُخُوا۟ is the practical act of blowing air into it. Care may motivate that labor, but the verb by itself does not express care.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N138.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"جَعَلَهُۥ\",\"after\":\"The transformation can be heard as an action undertaken with care for its object.\",\"reason\":\"B015 names genuine concern for a thing (العناية الصادقة بالشيء); جَعَلَهُۥ describes making the iron into a new state. The senses meet as care and an action directed toward the cared-for thing, a broad connection.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N138.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"أُفْرِغْ\",\"after\":\"The final directive joins sincere concern to deliberate pouring. The metalwork is voiced as a task to which the speaker is committed.\",\"reason\":\"B015 means sincere care for something (العناية الصادقة بالشيء); أُفْرِغْ also carries the sense of directing oneself toward a task (القصد إلى الأمر), alongside pouring. Both express purposeful attention to the work.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N139\",\"lines\":\"rnr\"}\n{\"id\":\"N139.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلْحَدِيدِ\",\"after\":\"The iron barrier becomes a literal boundary, while speech can be heard as a definition that sets limits. The material itself marks the pass's dividing line.\",\"reason\":\"B016 uses قول for a technical definition or limit (الحد); ٱلْحَدِيدِ names iron, whose plain sense here includes the barrier that distinguishes and blocks (الحاجز والغاية المميزة). The two senses meet in the iron's boundary-making role.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N139.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"بَيْنَ\",\"after\":\"The in-between space is defined by its edges. The work fills the interval between the two sides with a new boundary.\",\"reason\":\"B016 is a technical definition understood as a limit (الحد); بَيْنَ names the space between two things (الوسط بين شيئين). A defining limit complements the interval by giving it bounds.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N139.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قَالَ\",\"target_ar\":\"جَعَلَهُۥ\",\"after\":\"The transformation can faintly suggest a new definition of what the iron is.\",\"reason\":\"B016 treats قول as a technical definition of a thing (حده); جَعَلَهُۥ means bringing something into a state (تصيير الشيء على حال). The connection is thin: defining what something is and changing what it is are distinct acts.\"}"}}
